            </note>
            <note corresp="#d289-f3" n="3" xml:id="d289-f3-content">
                <p>A record of the Haig-Bourguiba meeting is in telegram 277315 to Tunis, October
                    17. (Department of State, Central Foreign Policy File, Electronic Telegrams,
                    D810491–0324)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d289-f4" n="4" xml:id="d289-f4-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d196-f3">footnote 3, Document 196</ref>.</p>
